    | AsyncExports
    | BracketEndBraceEnd
    | Any
    | ADotB
    | Mod
    | ABracket
    | ACommaSpace
    | ABracketEnd
    | BoundBy
    | BracketABracketEnd
    | IsUnbounded
    | No
    | Needs
    | BoundIt
    | DoesNotMatch
    | ItsIsNotS
    | ImplementIt
    | AField
    | FnA
    | ABColonSpaceC
    | ACloseSpaceBSpaceBraceSpaceEllipsisSpaceBraceEnd
    | Bcdefgh
    | Mem
    | MemCopyIn
    | MemView
    | NameKindHostTrue
    | Start
    | MemSet
    | MemReserve
    | MemGrow
    | MemPush
    | MemResize
    | Vec
    | MemLc
    | Mems
    | ParenthesizeThePipelineAXsAll
    | U32
    | U64
    | Len
    | Abs
    | Sqrt
    | Min
    | Max
    | Piped
    | TheSourceMeant
    | EndsHere
    | CannotFollow
    | Group
    | ATickBTick
    | Or
    | EndOfFile
    | ACharacter
    | AName
    | AnInteger
    | ANumber
    | AString
    | BackslashBackslash
    | SlashBackslash
    | ATemplateString
    | Open
    | Semi
    | At
    | Dollar
    | DotDotDot
    | DotDotLt
    | BarEq
    | Amp
    | AmpEq
    | Caret
    | CaretEq
    | Star
    | StarEq
    | Slash
    | SlashEq
    | Pct
    | PctEq
    | Plus
    | PlusEq
    | DashEq
    | Lt
    | LtEq
